`System.Text.Json` is fast, lightweight, and tightly integrated into .NET 6/7+. Once you understand the quirks above—especially about naming, non‑public members, and polymorphism—you’ll avoid the “it works in my test but blows up in production” bugs that plague many JSON‑heavy codebases. Happy serializing! 🚀
